{
  "title": "【怪現象】親父が毎朝ドル円を見て植木鉢を動かしてる件",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">1：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:42:00 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ちょっと聞いてくれ。<br>うちの親父、ここ一週間くらい毎朝新聞の為替欄を見てから、ベランダの植木鉢を左右に動かしてる。<br>昨日は右、今日は左。<br>何か意味があるのか聞いても『まあ見てろ』しか言わない。<br>親父は株も為替もやってないはずなんだが。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">2：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:42:40 ID:N4xT9vL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">新しいテクニカル分析だな。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">3：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:43:39 ID:H7rB3wF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">植木鉢が先行指標。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">4：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:44:04 ID:P2kD8sJ5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">お前の親父は何者だｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">5：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:44:48 ID:M9aC4qV1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">右が円高で左が円安か？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">6：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:45:51 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そこがわからん。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">7：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:46:20 ID:T3nW7yG8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何の植物？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">8：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:47:08 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res7\">&gt;&gt;7</a> アサガオだと思う。もう枯れかけてる。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">9：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:48:15 ID:L6fS2zK9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず植物を心配しろよ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:48:48 ID:R5pH8cN3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">10月にアサガオって時点でお察し。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">11：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:49:40 ID:B9vE4mQ2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">親父さん何歳？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">12：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:50:51 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58。去年定年退職した。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">13：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:51:28 ID:C2sJ7xT5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">暇なんじゃね？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">14：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:52:24 ID:F8wL3dP6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">暇だから為替と園芸を融合したのか。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">15：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:52:46 ID:G4qN9rH1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">鉢が動くと相場が動くんだろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">16：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:53:27 ID:V7kM2bS8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それだと親父が日銀総裁より強い。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">17：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:54:27 ID:Y3tF6aD4</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">植木鉢介入。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">18：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:54:53 ID:Z5hP8nC2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">ニュース速報で見たい。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">19：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:55:38 ID:N4xT9vL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『個人宅ベランダで謎の円買い観測』</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">20：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:56:42 ID:H7rB3wF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">近所の人が困惑するわ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">21：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:57:12 ID:P2kD8sJ5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">毎日同じ時間に動かすの？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">22：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:58:01 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\"><a href=\"#res21\">&gt;&gt;21</a> 朝8時くらい。新聞読んだあと。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">23：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:59:09 ID:M9aC4qV1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">東京市場が始まる前か。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">24：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 08:59:43 ID:T3nW7yG8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">本格的でﾜﾛﾀ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">25：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:00:36 ID:L6fS2zK9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">動かす距離は？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">26：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:01:48 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">だいたい30センチくらい。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">27：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:02:26 ID:R5pH8cN3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">微妙に具体的。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">28：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:03:23 ID:B9vE4mQ2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">鉢は一個だけ？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">29：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:03:46 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">三個あるけど動かすのは真ん中のやつ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">30：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:04:28 ID:C2sJ7xT5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">中央銀行ならぬ中央植木鉢。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">31：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:05:29 ID:F8wL3dP6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それ面白いと思って言ったのか。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">32：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:05:56 ID:G4qN9rH1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">本人に直接聞くのが一番早いだろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">33：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:06:42 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">聞いたら『お前にはまだ早い』って。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">34：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:07:47 ID:V7kM2bS8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">奥義扱いｗ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">35：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:08:18 ID:Y3tF6aD4</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58歳まで習得できない投資法。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">36：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:09:08 ID:Z5hP8nC2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">母ちゃんは何て言ってる？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">37：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:10:17 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『また始まった』って。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">38：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:10:52 ID:N4xT9vL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">常習犯なのかよ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">39：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:11:46 ID:H7rB3wF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">親父の過去が気になる。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res40\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">40：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:12:59 ID:P2kD8sJ5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">昔から妙なことする人？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res41\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">41：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:13:38 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">去年は庭の石を全部番号順に並べてた。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res42\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">42：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:14:36 ID:M9aC4qV1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">石に番号あるのか？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res43\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">43：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:15:00 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">マジックで書いてた。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res44\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">44：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:15:43 ID:T3nW7yG8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">暇を持て余しすぎだろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res45\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">45：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:16:45 ID:L6fS2zK9</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">そのうち植木鉢にローソク足描きそう。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res46\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">46：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:17:13 ID:R5pH8cN3</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">今から親父さんに新聞のどこ見てるか確認しろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res47\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">47：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:21:00 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まだ居間にいるから聞いてみる。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res48\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">48：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:22:06 ID:B9vE4mQ2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">実況ｷﾀｰ</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res49\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">49：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:22:38 ID:C2sJ7xT5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">家族会議開始。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res50\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">50：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:27:29 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">聞いてきた。為替欄を見てるのは間違いない。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res51\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">51：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:28:39 ID:F8wL3dP6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">何か理由は言った？</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res52\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">52：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:29:15 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">『数字が気になるんだ』だって。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res53\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">53：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:30:10 ID:Y3tF6aD4</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">その植木鉢を動かすと儲かるなら教えてほしい。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res54\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">54：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:30:31 ID:Z5hP8nC2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">まず何を買えばいいんだ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res55\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">55：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:31:11 ID:N4xT9vL2</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">アサガオの種だろ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res56\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">56：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:32:10 ID:H7rB3wF6</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">それはもう商品先物でも何でもない。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res57\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">57：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:35:05 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">母ちゃんに聞いたら理由わかった。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res58\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">58：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:35:49 ID:P2kD8sJ5</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">おっ。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res59\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">59：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:36:52 ID:K7mQ2pR8</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">新聞の為替欄を読んでると思ったら、その下に載ってる日の出の時刻を見てたらしい。鉢を日なたに置きたいんだと。</div></div><div class=\"res\" id=\"res60\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 14px!important\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">60：<span style=\"color:#008000!important\">名無しさん</span> 2001/10/18(木) 09:37:21 ID:M9aC4qV1</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important\">為替関係ねえｗ</div></div></div></div><div class=\"fc2_footer\" style=\"text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;height:auto;\">\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n",
